op picks up ready tasks\\n4. Agent can resolve conflicts and retry\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Migration Path\\n\\n1. Add new columns to schema (non-breaking)\\n2. Implement workspace.rs with jj operations\\n3. Update tools to use workspace.rs\\n4. Remove worktree.rs\\n5. Update documentation\\n6. Update integration tests\\n\\n---\",\n3|   \"domain\": \"api\",\n4|   \"other_domains\": [\n5|     \"data\",\n6|     \"performance\"\n7|   ],\n8|   \"security_level\": \"internal\",\n9|   \"review_output\": \"- [HIGH] Timestamp race\\n- [HIGH] No releasing guard\\n- [HIGH] jj rebase rewrites commits\\n- [MEDIUM] jj rebase exit status\\n- [MEDIUM] Commit pinning vs late work\",\n10|   \"findings_acted_on\": [\n11|     \"Timestamp race\",\n12|     \"No releasing guard\",\n13|     \"jj rebase rewrites commits\",\n14|     \"jj rebase exit status\",\n15|     \"Commit pinning vs late work\"\n16|   ],\n17|   \"findings_ignored\": [],\n18|   \"missed_issues\": [],\n19|   \"stayed_in_lane\": true,\n20|   \"severity_gold\": {\n21|     \"HIGH\": 3,\n22|     \"MEDIUM\": 2\n23|   },\n24|   \"plan_id\": \"jj-workspace-migration\",\n25|   \"iteration\": 3\n26| }\n</file>"
